        "checksum": "95f8f2df6b56a7ea84415619e0fb5cefa89a5c2645a2cbe124d9ac384ead14b2_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggq8aY2vaOc_text": "FAQs",
        "ggOLFSsDJpv_text": "<p>Have questions? We’re here to help<\/p>",
        "ggf7RXVZMuu_childItem_0": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>What can a water flosser help with?<\/strong><\/span><\/p>",
        "ggf7RXVZMuu_childItem_1": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>Do I brush my teeth before or after using a water flosser?<\/strong><\/span><\/p>",
        "ggf7RXVZMuu_childItem_2": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>How often should you use a water flosser?<\/strong><\/span><\/p>",
        "ggf7RXVZMuu_childItem_3": "<p>How do I clean my water flosser?<\/p>",
        "gg6ZfrwqSPN_text": "<p>It helps target areas between teeth and along the gumline, where food debris and build-up can collect. This can help with everyday concerns like trapped food, bad breath, and gum discomfort. <\/p>",
        "ggI4J8oqm1q_text": "<p>Use your water flosser before brushing. It helps remove trapped food and plaque from hard-to-reach areas, allowing your toothbrush and toothpaste to clean more effectively. However, using it after brushing can also help flush away any remaining debris.<\/p>",
        "ggJ1FIRFpLD_text": "<p>For the best results, use a water flosser once a day as part of your oral care routine. Regular daily use helps remove plaque and trapped food while supporting healthier gums and fresher breath.<\/p>",
        "ggy2Y8Qd9Qr_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#0e101a;\">Empty and rinse the water tank after each use to help prevent residue from building up. Clean the nozzle and reservoir regularly to keep your water flosser hygienic and performing at its best.<\/span><\/p>",
        "ggTaPetv3Aw_text": "Still have a question?",
        "ggeq7wv2l7H_text": "We’re here to help—send us a message anytime!",
        "gg4V1nsJkbK_successMessage": "Thanks for contacting us. We'll get back to you as soon as possible.",
        "gg4V1nsJkbK_errorMessage": "Can’t send email. Please try again later.",
        "gg3jrQZjvo-_text": "Email",
        "ggc175qFstk_placeholder": "Email",
        "ggV3LbMmTL7_text": "Message",
        "ggHZ8aaBp5i_placeholder": "Message",
        "ggNTUm3D0PR_label": "Submit"
      }
